      "reason": "The user specifies computing each source’s Niño 3.4 index on its own native grid, so this fragment applies because regional averages should be computed natively and regridding is only for visual or pattern comparison purposes.",
      "status": "condensed",
      "notes": [
        "Do **not** regrid for the Niño 3.4 index: averages belong on each field’s own grid with its own cell areas; regridding would replace those weights with the target grid’s.",
        "If any map or shared-grid diagnostic is added beyond the request, state the regridding method used; but the asked amplitude metrics should come from native-grid calculations."
